st be green from the Actions app at the\nhead, and a run without a readable check_suite is refused. The green\nfixture's failure-then-success pair is one suite (a re-run), as it meant.\n\nRed first: plants for an older red suite beside a newer green one, and a\nsuite-less run, each let --apply PUT before the fix. Live, read-only\n--dry-run at #2649's head: `gate-at-head: PASS -- 4 suite(s); every suite's\nnewest gate is green`. Self-test 57/0.", "timestamp": "2026-10-23T07:31:44Z", "author": {"name": "tvofi", "email": "70032254+tvofi@users.noreply.github.com"}, "committer": {"name": "tvofi", "email": "70032254+tvofi@users.noreply.github.com"}}, "repository": {"id": 1341087606, "node_id": "R_kgDOT-9fdg", "name": "heatpump_optimizer", "full_name": "tvofi/heatpump_optimizer", "private": false, "owner": {"login": "tvofi", "id": 70032254, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDMyMjU0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70032254?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/tvofi", "html_url": "https://github.com/tvofi", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/tvofi/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/tvofi/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/tvofi/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/tvofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/tvofi/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/tvofi/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/tvofi/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/tvofi/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/tvofi/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "html_url": "https://github.com/tvofi/heatpump_optimizer", "description": "Home Assistant integration that plans heat pump space heating and hot water against electricity prices, weather and a two-zone thermal model.", "fork": false, "url": "https://api